        "template--16155228307619__68f21f02-4e27-439d-8c2d-230d9b48ebc5-167533762479399dd1-1": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "No frizz, no dullness",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "9bb5cebe-0abd-42dc-9b66-aa94554b7268": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Only smoothness and shine. That’s what our keratin treatment is all about. Groundbreaking smoothing treatment formula that is the first of its kind - not only vegan and clean but also easy to use at home.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "a0c9adb6-a16b-4c40-ba57-763af6b139e6": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "44ce19df-93cb-49e1-99b8-0af90bb4651a": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Be your own expert",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "562a955b-8bcb-40d9-bee3-a3dc8712fe83": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Achieve professional salon-quality results at home in just a few easy steps. For the fraction of the salon prices.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "bd284d46-c3aa-4844-8e49-b578ec01be36": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "c30ca1c0-abf7-48a0-bd27-0b96b7828e93": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "For all hair types, textures, and tones",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "3b30f82a-3e21-42c6-82df-6f3144df95fe": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Whether you want to get rid of frizz or just want your curls shiny and manageable, the treatment will give you a frizz-free, fuss-free look that lasts for three months.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
